  "properties": {
    "title": "Combining remote sensing data and geospatial datasets to improve a national wetlands inventory",
    "description": "Combining geospatial and remote sensing data to create accurate representations of national wetlands from diverse datasets raises technical and real-world challenges. \r\nThis talk covers how we minimize negative impacts of technical decisions while maximizing positive outcomes, and how we combine multiple datasets to support national wetlands mapping and monitoring.\n\n_",
